  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Dwarka Hybrid Renewables and Energy Storage Project, through Evergreen Power Solutions, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study for Shivman Wind Energy Private Limited, a private renewable energy developer in India, to support the development of a 300-megawatt wind-solar-storage hybrid power plant. The study will evaluate the economic feasibility of the project; develop technical specifications, designs, and plans; review and identify necessary permits; and analyze potential environmental impacts of the project.</narrative>
  </description>
